Upstream: none found.

A floor 0 book index is read with ilog(floor0_number_of_books) bits. With 16 books that is 5 bits,
so the index can be 16..31 and indexed past the 16-entry book list. The Vorbis I specification
makes a packet with an index past the book list undecodable.

